hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715370/extras/31c82c8c62ae32dca8522f1337557858.poster.avif?t=1746519341\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715370/extras/31c82c8c62ae32dca8522f1337557858.webm?t=1746519341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715370/extras/31c82c8c62ae32dca8522f1337557858.mp4?t=1746519341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Ethereal essence fuels our advance, Endless path through time and space.&quot;</i><br>After all, in this corrupted and decaying fallen world, this is the only way to gain power without pain or hidden dangers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715370/extras/b4971e65c8e00bcfd694a885a26e0800.avif?t=1746519341\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
